        "original_id": "32e7a1a2-bccb-5948-a5b3-e6ff3b2f7980",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chino Moreno, Sergio Vega\n- Bands and Music Projects: Deftones, Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, Palms\n- Songs and Albums: “Tempest”, Koi No Yokan\n- Places: Sacramento, California\n- Platforms: PureVolume\n\nFacts:\n- Deftones is a Sacramento, California-based alternative metal band.\n- “Tempest” is the second single by Deftones from their seventh studio album, Koi No Yokan.\n- “Tempest” debuted on PureVolume’s official website on October 3, 2012.\n- A video released with “Tempest” featured Deftones members Chino Moreno and Sergio Vega discussing the track.\n- Chino Moreno is also a member of the side-project groups Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, and Palms.",
